WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.766
Welcome to Computer Class. Today you will learn: Mouse and Keyboard Basics.

2
00:00:06.066 --> 00:00:11.272
Use the mouse and the main keys with confidence. Follow each step on your own computer.

3
00:00:12.283 --> 00:00:20.618
Step one. Left click selects an item. Double-click, two quick clicks, opens it. Try opening This PC.

4
00:00:21.617 --> 00:00:28.950
Step two. Right-click opens a menu. Right-click on an item to see choices such as Open, Rename and Properties.

5
00:00:29.950 --> 00:00:33.914
Step three. Use the wheel on the mouse to scroll a page up and down.

6
00:00:34.917 --> 00:00:44.569
Step four. Learn four keys. Enter makes a new line. Space makes a space. Backspace deletes. Hold Shift to type a capital letter.

7
00:00:45.583 --> 00:00:49.385
Now it is your turn. Try these tasks on your own computer.

8
00:00:49.685 --> 00:00:52.555
Double-click This PC to open it.

9
00:00:52.855 --> 00:00:55.064
Right-click a file and read the menu.

10
00:00:55.364 --> 00:00:57.956
Scroll a long web page with the wheel.

11
00:00:58.256 --> 00:00:59.361
Well done!

